 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【足球战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/match2057415date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球大战！国米5-3乌迪内斯开局四连胜 图拉姆传射巴雷拉建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.62" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057415_1789418176_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.62" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.62" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057415_1789418176_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057415_1789418176_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">国米开场先丢两球，5-3逆转乌迪内斯。积分榜方面，国米开局四连胜积12分暂第二，乌迪内斯4分第13。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/match2057423date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4连胜领跑！罗马2-0都灵 马伦4轮6球领跑射手榜皮西利补时建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057423_1789410348_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057423_1789410348_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2057423_1789410348_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">罗马客场2-0战胜都灵。本场比赛过后，罗马联赛4轮全胜积12分暂时领跑积分榜，马伦4轮6球领跑射手榜。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/match2067681date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">升至第三！利兹联4-1送纽卡赛季首败 勒温传射田中碧造乌龙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2067681_1789418984_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2067681_1789418984_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260915/zhanbao_image_2067681_1789418984_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">利兹联4-1击败纽卡，纽卡遭遇本赛季联赛首败，利兹联升至英超第三。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">【足球动态】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-14/6aa81392d156dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">回看曼城进球判断出错！多家英媒：曼市德比VAR裁判本周末被停哨</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/6aa8398847dd7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">邮报：被停哨的曼市德比两位VAR裁判，将被禁止执法曼联的比赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/6aa74910d86c4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/6aa74910d86c4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/6aa74910d86c4.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据邮报、TA、BBC、镜报等多家媒体报道，在昨日进行的曼市德比之后，当值VAR裁判马特·多诺霍和助理视频助理裁判（AVAR）布兰科·安特罗布斯在本周末将被处以停哨处罚，他们没有入选本周末执法英超的裁判名单。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-14/6aa81281ced7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联手内马尔！官方：桑托斯免签34岁库蒂尼奥，签约至2026年底</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/202609142329149036.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/202609142329149036_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/202609142329149036_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">官方消息，桑托斯免签34岁库蒂尼奥，签约至2026年底。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/6aa82cc5639d1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金球争夺战！RMC：姆巴佩对登贝莱言论感到惊讶，但不会公开回应</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.97" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609150122267042.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.97" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.97" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609150122267042.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609150122267042.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据RMC报道，姆巴佩对登贝莱的言论感到惊讶，但不会公开回应。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-14/6aa809e1c2d60native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛杯客战红军！德泽尔比：里沙利松上不了，我不可能天天求他留下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a9332abb5049_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a9332abb5049_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/6a9332abb5049_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">联赛杯第3轮，热刺将做客安菲尔德挑战利物浦。赛前，德泽尔比谈到了多名球员的出战情况，并回应了里沙利松的潜在未来问题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-14/6aa80e326a09bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">几乎宣判死刑！考文垂开局4连败，英超仅1支升班马这样还能保级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260914/202609142309565539.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260914/202609142309565539.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260914/202609142309565539.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">考文垂昨晚在英超0-5惨败布莱顿，遭遇联赛开局四连败。OPTA统计，在本赛季之前，英超历史上有7支升班马球队开局四连败，结果只有1支球队最终成功保级。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-14/6aa80f2180119native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">勒沃库森总监否认本泽马将加盟球队：我们的阵容已经确定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260914/202609140426537229.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; 